SYNTHESIS
  The external lenses are productive when they are used as quotient tests.
  Gibbs and double-slit language says why measuring individual bands breaks
  the proof. Road coloring exactly recovers the singleton death chain.
  Cat-map and Hopfield structure expose the signed debt alphabet but do not
  give prefix/local monotonicity. Fubini-Study geometry is a diagnostic, not
  an order. The proof carrier remains miss-zeta generated context plus the
  signed seven-band death-chain aggregate.
